# The Alpine Linux files the harness's Linux root is built from
# (build-root.sh), pinned by version and SHA-256. Fields: kind, file, sha256.
# "release" files come from releases/x86_64 (kept by Alpine for every
# release); "main" packages from the branch's main repository. Alpine keeps
# only the current version of a package in a branch: when a pinned package
# is replaced, build-root.sh takes the branch's current version (named in
# its APKINDEX) and says so in the build log; update the pin then.
